OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity staff to be balloted   
OL,4,Afor strike action                      
OL,6,FUniversity staff will be balloted for  
OL,7,Fstrike action in an ongoing dispute    
OL,8,Fover jobs.                             
OL,10,FThe University of Sunderland has       
OL,11,Fplanned #40m in savings over the next  
OL,12,Fyear, with up to 188 jobs at risk of   
OL,13,Fbeing cut, and has refused to rule out 
OL,14,Fcompulsory redundancies.               
OL,16,FUCU general secretary Jo Grady said    
OL,17,Fballoting for strike action was not a  
OL,18,Fdecision members make lightly, but the 
OL,19,Funion was "determined to defend jobs   
OL,20,Fand the future of the university".     
