OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity staff to be balloted   
OL,4,Afor strike action                      
OL,6,FThe university said it was             
OL,7,F"disappointed" the union had chosen to 
OL,8,Fballot for industrial action and it had
OL,9,Fagreed to not issue dismissal notices  
OL,10,Funtil next year.                       
